</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus is the Name to sound,</l><l>Name to rally fainting hearts!</l><l>To recapture “forfeit” ground,</l><l>Lost awhile through Satan’s arts.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Backward drive the Evil One!</l><l>Force him out of every hold;</l><l>Smite until the sinking sun</l><l>Sets upon the warrior bold!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In the Overcomer’s Name</l><l>Be an overcomer too!</l><l>Stand and put the foe to shame</l><l>All the livelong battle through!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
